hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2069","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Nabi ki qabool honay wali dua hai jiskay sath wo dua karta hai. Aur main chaahta hun ke apni dua ko aakhirat mein apni ummat key liye sifaarish chhupaun. (Bukhari: 6304)"
"2070","[AI-translation] Aus key betey Shaddaad (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Istighfaar ka sardaar hai ke tum kaho: Ae Allah! Tum merey Rab ho, terey siwa koi mabood nahi. Tum ne mujhey paida kya aur main tumhaara banda hun. Aur main apne ahd aur apne waaday par hun jitna taaqat rakhta hun. Main teri panaah maangta hun jo main ne kya uski buraai se. Main terey saamney teri mujh par naimat ka iqraar karta hun aur terey saamney apne gunaah ka iqraar karta hun. To mujhey maaf farma! Beshak gunaah terey siwa koi maaf nahi karta. Aap ne farmaya: Aur jo use din mein yaqeen key sath kahey aur apne din mein shaam honay se pehley maray to wo Jannat walon mein se hai. Aur jo use raat mein kahey jabke wo us par yaqeen rakhta ho aur subah honay se pehley maray to wo Jannat walon mein se hai. (Bukhari: 6306)"
"2071","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah ki qasam beshak main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun aur uski taraf tauba karta hun din mein sattar martaba se zyada. (Bukhari: 6307)"
"2072","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne do hadeesein bayan kein: Aik Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. Aur doosri apne aap se. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak momin apne gunaahon ko dekhta hai goya wo pahaad key neechey baitha hai aur darta hai ke wo us par girayga. Aur beshak faasiq apne gunaahon ko makkhi jaisa dekhta hai jo uski naak par guzri aur us ne uskey sath aisa kaha. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah apne bandey ki tauba se aadmi se zyada khush hota hai jo manzil mein utra jabke us mein halaakat hai. Aur uskey sath uski sawaari hai jis par uska khaana aur uska peena hai. To us ne apna sar rakkha aur neend soya. Phir jaaga jabke uski sawaari jaa chuki thi. Yahan tak ke jab us par garmi aur pyaas sakht hui ya jo Allah ne chaaaha. Us ne kaha: Main apni jagah wapas jaaunga. To wo wapas aaya aur neend soya. Phir us ne apna sar uthaaya aur uski sawaari uskey paas thi. (Bukhari: 6308)"
"2073","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat ko apne bistar mein letey to apna haath apne gaal key neechey rakhtey, phir farmaatey: Ae Allah! Terey naam se marta hun aur jeeta hun. Aur jab jaagtey to farmaatey: Allah ki hamd jis ne hamein uskey baad zinda kya jab us ne hamein maara tha. Aur uski taraf uthna hai. (Bukhari: 6314)"
"2074","[AI-translation] Aazib key betey Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne bistar mein aatey to apne daaen pehlu par sotey, phir farmaatey: Ae Allah! Main ne apne aap ko terey supurd kya. Aur apna chehra teri taraf kya. Aur apna muamla terey supurd kya. Aur apni peeth teri taraf lagaae. Teri taraf raghbat aur khauf sey. Teri taraf key siwa panaah aur najaat nahi hai. Main teri Kitaab par imaan laaya jo tum ne naazil ki. Aur terey Nabi par jo tum ne bheja. (Bukhari: 6315)"
"2075","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Maimoona key paas raat guzaara, aur hadees zikr ki aur wo guzar chuki hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo apni dua mein kehtey they: Ae Allah! Merey dil mein noor bana! Aur meri nigaah mein noor! Aur merey kaan mein noor! Aur merey daaen noor! Aur merey baaen noor! Aur merey upar noor! Aur merey neechey noor! Aur merey aagey noor! Aur merey peechey noor! Aur merey liye noor bana! (Bukhari: 6316)"
"2076","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bistar mein aaey to apne bistar ko apne tehband key andar se jhaadey. Beshak wo nahi jaanta ke uskey peechey us par kya hai. Phir kahey: Terey naam se ae merey Rab main ne apna pehlu rakkha aur terey sath uthata hun. Agar tum meri jaan rok lo to us par rehem farma! Aur agar use bhej do to uski hifaazat farma jiskay sath tum apne nek bandon ki hifaazat kartey ho! (Bukhari: 6320)"
"2077","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein koi na kahey: Ae Allah! Mujhey maaf farma agar chaaaho! Ae Allah! Mujh par rehem farma agar chaaaho! Use sawaal pakka karna chaahiye. Beshak use majboor karney wala koi nahi hai. (Bukhari: 6339)"
"2078","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ki qabool hoti hai jab tak wo jaldi na karey. Wo kehta hai: Main ne dua ki aur meri qabool nahi hui. (Bukhari: 6340)"
"2079","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) takleef key waqt farmaatey they: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi jo Azeem Haleem hai. Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi jo Azeem Arsh ka Rab hai. Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi jo aasmaanon ka Rab aur zameen ka Rab aur izzat walay Arsh ka Rab hai. (Bukhari: 6346)"
"2080","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bala ki mehnat aur badnaseebi key paaney aur buray faisley aur dushmanon key khush honay se panaah maangtey they. Sufyan ne kaha jabke wo is hadees key raawiyon mein se aik hain: Hadees teen hain. Main ne aik badhaaee, mujhey nahi maloom wo kaunsi hai. (Bukhari: 6347)"
"2081","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Ae Allah! Phir jis momin ko main ne gaali di to use uskey liye Qiyaamat key din teri taraf qurbat bana! (Bukhari: 6361)"
"2082","[AI-translation] Abu Waqqaas key betey Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) paanch ka hukm detey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main teri panaah maangta hun bakheeli se. Aur teri panaah maangta hun buzdili se. Aur teri panaah maangta hun ke main zaleel umr ki taraf lautaaya jaaun. Aur teri panaah maangta hun duniya key fitney se, yaani Dajjaal key fitney se. Aur teri panaah maangta hun qabr key azaab se. (Bukhari: 6365)"
"2083","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaatey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main teri panaah maangta hun susti aur budhapey aur gunaah aur qarz se. Aur qabr key fitney aur qabr key azaab se. Aur aag key fitney aur aag key azaab se. Aur maaldaari key fitney ki buraai se. Aur teri panaah maangta hun faqeeri key fitney se. Aur teri panaah maangta hun Maseeh Dajjaal key fitney se. Ae Allah! Merey gunaah mujh se barf aur aulon key paani se dho dey! Aur merey dil ko gunaahon se paak farma jaisa tum ne safed kapda gandagi se paak kya! Aur merey aur merey gunaahon key darmiyaan doori farma jaisa tum ne mashriq aur maghrib key darmiyaan doori ki! (Bukhari: 6368)"
"2084","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aksar dua thi: Ae Allah! Ae hamaarey Rab! Hamein duniya mein bhalai dey aur aakhirat mein bhalai dey aur hamein aag key azaab se bacha! (Bukhari: 6389)"
"2085","[AI-translation] Ashaari Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke wo dua kartey they: Ae Allah! Meri khata aur meri jaahaalat aur merey muamley mein meri ziyaadti aur jo tum mujh se zyada jaantey ho maaf farma! Ae Allah! Meri hansi aur meri sanjeedgi aur meri ghalti aur mera iraada maaf farma! Aur wo sab merey paas hai. (Bukhari: 6399)"
"2086","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kahey: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, Wo Akela hai, uska koi shareek nahi. Uska mulk hai aur uski hamd hai. Aur wo har cheez par qaadir hai. Din mein sau martaba. Wo uskey liye das gardanon key baraabar thi. Aur uskey liye sau nekiyaan likhi gaein. Aur us se sau buraaiyaan mitaai gaein. Aur wo uskey liye uska din shaam tak shaitaan se hifaazat thi. Aur koi us se afzal ley kar na aaya jo wo laaya magar aadmi jis ne us se zyada kya. (Bukhari: 6403)"
"2087","[AI-translation] Aur Ansaari Abu Ayyub aur Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha is hadees mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo das martaba kahey wo us jaisa tha jis ne Ismaeel ki aulaad mein se gardan aazaad ki. (Bukhari: 6404)"
"2088","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kahey: Allah paak hai aur uski hamd hai, din mein sau martaba. Uskey gunaah mitaaye jaaengey agarchey samandar ki jhaag jaisey hon. (Bukhari: 6405)"
"2089","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Uski misaal jo apne Rab ko yaad karta hai aur jo apne Rab ko yaad nahi karta, zinda aur murda jaisi hai. (Bukhari: 6407)"
"2090","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah key farishtey hain jo raaston mein ghoomtey hain aur zikr walon ko talaash kartey hain. Phir jab wo qaum ko paatey hain jo Allah ko yaad karti hai to pukaartey hain: Aao apni haajat ki taraf! Unhon-ne kaha: To wo unhey apne paron se neechey waley aasmaan tak ghertay hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To unka Rab un se poochhta hai jabke wo un se zyada jaanta hai: Merey banday kya kehtey hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Wo teri tasbeeh aur teri takbeer aur teri hamd aur teri buzurgi bayan kartey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo farmaata hai: Kya unhon-ne mujhey dekha hai? Unhon-ne kaha: To wo kehtey hain: Nahi, Allah ki qasam unhon-ne tumhey nahi dekha. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo farmaata hai: Aur kaisa hota agar wo mujhey dekhtey? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Agar wo tumhey dekhtey to wo teri ibaadat mein zyada sakht hotey aur teri buzurgi aur tareef mein zyada sakht aur teri tasbeeh mein zyada. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo farmaata hai: To wo mujh se kya maangtey hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo tum se Jannat maangtey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo farmaata hai: Aur kya unhon-ne use dekha hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Nahi, Allah ki qasam ae merey Rab unhon-ne use nahi dekha. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo farmaata hai: To kaisa hota agar wo use dekhtey? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Agar wo use dekhtey to wo us par zyada harees hotey aur uskey liye zyada talab karney waley aur us mein badi raghbat walay. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kis se panaah maangtey hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Aag se. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo farmaata hai: Aur kya unhon-ne use dekha hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Nahi, Allah ki qasam ae merey Rab unhon-ne use nahi dekha. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo farmaata hai: To kaisa hota agar wo use dekhtey? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Agar wo use dekhtey to wo us se zyada bhaagne waley hotey aur us se zyada darnay walay. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo farmaata hai: To main tumhey gawaah banaata hun ke main ne unhey maaf kar diya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Farishton mein se farishta kehta hai: Un mein fulaan hai jo un mein se nahi hai. Wo sirf haajat key liye aaya tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo baithney walay hain, unka saathi unkey sabab badnaseeb nahi hota. (Bukhari: 6408). Narmi ki kitaab."
